chapter start
name: section-goal
title start
name: title-goal
Goal
title end
paragraph start
name: paragraph-goal-one-theme
One theme file declares the look once. Notation views, editor,
multiplexer, shell and website all read it. Change the file and
every package shows the change. No package ships its own colors.
