chapter start
name: section-decided
title start
name: title-decided
Decided
title end
paragraph start
name: paragraph-decided-roles
A tool names roles, never colors. Roles: text, dim 
(unfocused), error (also open todos), bg. The theme file 
maps each role to a value. Themes live in themes/ at the 
ecosystem root. Default: monochrome-dark. Text white, dim 
gray, error red, bg none: terminals are transparent and the 
website sets no background.
paragraph end
paragraph start
name: paragraph-decided-file
The active theme is one small plain file that every tool reads.
A bad theme is fixed by editing that file, with no rebuild. Own
tools repaint live when it changes. Racket first, Rust only where
a renderer needs it.
paragraph end
chapter end

