paragraph start
name: paragraph-step-4-decided
Step 4 decided. theme.rkt is one file copied into editor 
and multiplexer at tui/theme/, as the bars are copied 
today. Folder: env AIU_THEME_DIR, else the path in 
~/.config/aiu/theme-dir. API: theme-sgr ROLE, theme-rgb 
ROLE, theme-stamp (changes when the file changes, checked 
every 150 ms). Roles are strings. Bad values fall back to 
the defaults.
