paragraph end
paragraph start
name: paragraph-step-5-decided
Step 5 decided. rendering/theme.rs, mod in main.rs only 
(the bin, not lib). paint(codes, s): codes under 30 stay 
styles, 31 maps to role error, 90 to role dim, other color 
codes are dropped. Both color_code copies and the color: 
branch of style() are deleted: sgr already dropped block 
colors. Plain text stays terminal default, the text role is 
for apps that paint their own text. Each run reads the 
theme fresh.
